{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07307","headline":"观李凑所画美人障子 · 刘长卿","name":"观李凑所画美人障子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱尔含天姿，丹青有殊智。\n无间已得象，象外更生意。\n西子不可见，千载无重还。\n空令浣沙态，犹在含毫间。\n一笑岂易得，双蛾如有情。\n窗风不举袖，但觉罗衣轻。\n华堂翠幕春风来，内阁金屏曙色开。\n此中一见乱人目，只疑行到云阳台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}